    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Okay. Because one of the things actually we learned looking at this primary because there was talk about, you know, Democrats switching over to vote for Liz Cheney in the primary. And then someone pointed out that if every single Democrat had done that, there still just wouldn't have been enough. They're just not a whole lot of Democrats in Wyoming.",
