    "turn_idx": 102,
    "turn_text": "Now, the Justice Department has press charges, file charges against over 800 people now. And there was, I mean, there was really ugly hand-to-hand fighting going on in some areas around the Capitol and mostly around the Capitol. And so they're prosecuting people who are involved with that. I mean, what's your feeling about those prosecutions?",
