    "turn_idx": 111,
    "turn_text": "I don't know how that needs to be investigated. The one that exists right now is so horrifically tainted that clearly they can have nothing to do with any of it ever again. They have no credibility at all. How you put together or what we put together in order to address this. I don't know what the answer is, but I will tell you this. Sunshine is the best disinfectant. The way we're going to get to the bottom of this is just flat disclosing everything that happened. As a government that is for the people rather than the other way around, it's not too much to ask for",
