    "turn_text": "But it has been. Personally, I think it's been informative. I don't know how deeply you've gotten into all this stuff, but the role of John Eastman and the role of some of the lawyers and the plans for the alternate delegates and all of that stuff, I think that's been very useful for us to learn, don't you?",
