      },
      {
        "text": "Legitimate concerns exist regarding events in the 2020 election, Zuckerberg’s donation, Wisconsin, and Pennsylvania.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "People have the right to question governmental actions.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "John Eastman and others proposed legal arguments based on their belief that the Biden administration attempted to steal the election.",
