  {
    "episode_id": 50982,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/0/50982.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 116,
    "turn_text": "We're getting close to the end here. We've been talking about Liz Cheney, and I mentioned briefly her father. Now, in this race, I mean, your family's been in Wyoming for multiple generations, right? As has hers. So what's your feeling of the sort of the legacy of the Chinese in Wyoming as we get to a period where there's not going to be a Cheney in public office?",
